00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:37.960
En fait,

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:38.720
le Web Scraping, c'est

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:39.400
un petit robot

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.800
qui va chercher les informations

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:41.920
